$CSTP_FILE_RECORD_MARK_ID_START(/support/uselib.txt);
Natvc is a system written in the Calcium language. 
Writing Natvc requires the use of some libraries. 
For ease of maintenance, this directory will list all the libraries used.

Some software packages may not be directly included in Natvc, 
but auxiliary components use these libraries.

==============Used Library========================

By FDL & FoxaXu:
Calcium Project (FoxaXu)  --Based Language &Run Core
Biato Core (FDL)  --Based Emulate System underlying kernel
NetVdisk Manager Core (FDL)  --For emulate virtual disk on local folder

By Community:
Natvc System Developer Tookit  --Dev and test system
"Open Natvc Setup Media" Create Tools  --Make System setup Media
Calcium Enhanced Tools for Natvc  --Drivers for Natvc

By Third-Party Toolkit:
Windows Batch Script(Microsoft)   --Manage system file
Natvc NTFS&FAT32 Driver (FDL)  --For Compatible Windows Path Directory.
Windows URLDownloadFiles (urlmon.dll) API  --For download file from internet on Windows
LibCurl (curl.h) API  --For download file from internet on Windows&Linux(unix)

Server Provider:
Github Pages  --Services for Natvc Network services URL : https://fdl-cds.dev.foxaxu.com
Local Nginx Server  --Services for Natvc Network services URL : https://dev.foxaxu.com
$CSTP_FILE_RECORD_MARK_ID_END(/support/uselib.txt);
